<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n115211" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χωρ-ικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χώρα</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>rustic, rural,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Vett.Val.
				7.8
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐργάται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>POxy.</u>
					141.5
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(vi A. D.)</span>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				9.13
			</span></i>; in Egypt, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λειτουργίαι χ.,</span>
			of services <i>rendered in the</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χώρα,</span> i.e. outside Alexandria (cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χώρα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					11.3
				</span></i>
			), <i><span class="en">
				<u>OGI</u>
				669.34
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i A. D.)</span>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χ. βιβλιοθήκη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PFlor.</u>
					46.1
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(ii A. D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>indigenous,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάλαμος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PMag.Par.</u>
					1.63
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρτεμισία</span> cj. for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χλωρ-</span> (q. v.) ib.<i><span class="en">
				914
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φῦκος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PHolm.</u>
					21.45
				</span></i>
			.</div>
